"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/shipping-1.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:29:\"Simple Shipment Tracking Link\";s:4:\"copy\";s:59:\"Add shipment tracking information and links to your orders.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:56:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/shipment-tracking-link/\";}i:11;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:62:\"orders-list-empty-body-backorder-manager-global-category-rules\";s:7:\"context\";s:22:\"orders-list-empty-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:39:\"backorder-manager-global-category-rules\";s:4:\"icon\";s:81:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/backorder-manager-icon-160.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:44:\"Backorder Manager: Global and Category Rules\";s:4:\"copy\";s:205:\"Control backorders across your WooCommerce store from one clean settings screen. Set global rules, target specific categories, and keep product-level exceptions in place without changing your product data.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:73:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/backorder-manager-global-category-rules/\";}i:12;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:49:\"orders-list-empty-body-postcodeaddress-validation\";s:7:\"context\";s:22:\"orders-list-empty-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:26:\"postcodeaddress-validation\";s:4:\"icon\";s:78:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/skyverge-wc-icon-b2vhw6.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:27:\"Postcode/Address Validation\";s:4:\"copy\";s:104:\"Simplify your checkout process by having your customer validate or lookup their address during checkout.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:60:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/postcodeaddress-validation/\";}i:13;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:49:\"orders-list-empty-body-geekseller-for-woocommerce\";s:7:\"context\";s:22:\"orders-list-empty-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:26:\"geekseller-for-woocommerce\";s:4:\"icon\";s:65:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/80x80.png?w=80\";s:5:\"title\";s:40:\"GeekSeller Multichannel Order Management\";s:4:\"copy\";s:125:\"Transform your WooCommerce store into a multichannel order management hub (Walmart, Amazon, eBay, Overstock, Etsy, and more).\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:60:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/geekseller-for-woocommerce/\";}i:14;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:44:\"orders-list-empty-body-canal-for-woocommerce\";s:7:\"context\";s:22:\"orders-list-empty-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:21:\"canal-for-woocommerce\";s:4:\"icon\";s:81:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Canal_WC_Icon_160x160_v1-1.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:5:\"Canal\";s:4:\"copy\";s:101:\"Sell 3rd party products without taking on inventory risk with Canal’s modern dropshipping solution.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:55:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/canal-for-woocommerce/\";}i:15;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:64:\"orders-list-empty-body-delivery-pickup-scheduler-for-woocommerce\";s:7:\"context\";s:22:\"orders-list-empty-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:41:\"delivery-pickup-scheduler-for-woocommerce\";s:4:\"icon\";s:81:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/delivery-slot-icon-new-160.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:29:\"Delivery and Pickup Scheduler\";s:4:\"copy\";s:139:\"Allow users to select a date & time of delivery/pickup for orders & products. You can also display an estimated date for orders & products.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:75:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/delivery-pickup-scheduler-for-woocommerce/\";}i:16;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:33:\"orders-list-empty-body-royal-mail\";s:7:\"context\";s:22:\"orders-list-empty-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:10:\"royal-mail\";s:4:\"icon\";s:75:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/04/woo-RoyalMail-sd9zwy.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:26:\"Royal Mail Shipping Method\";s:4:\"copy\";s:50:\"Offer Royal Mail shipping rates to your customers.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:44:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/royal-mail/\";}i:17;a:9:{s:4:\"slug\";s:42:\"product-edi